<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine tobacco firm Nobleza Q1 net $9.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentine tobacco firm Nobleza Q1 net $9.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31.</p>
<p>Net $9.1 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Nobleza-Piccardo, Argentine unit of British American Tobacco Industries Plc, provided no comparatives nor EPS.</p>
<p>It said its first quarter result followed a $4.5 million income tax payment.</p>
<p>At March 31 its net worth stood at $151.71 million.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
